@prefix schema: <https://schema.org/> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix ex: <https://example.test/> .

schema:Thing a schema:Class .
schema:ExternalChild a schema:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf schema:Thing, ex:ExternalParent .
schema:externalProperty a schema:Property ; schema:domainIncludes schema:ExternalChild, ex:ExternalDomain ; schema:rangeIncludes ex:ExternalRange .
